Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Simulator: validate real KV transfers before
 simulated-only branches

- reject offloading connectors and kv_offloading_size in real mode
- reject kv_transfer_mode real without simulate_forward
- test real CPU KV allocation and registration with a recording connector
---
